WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.895
- "The Office" had a huge comeback.

00:00:01.895 --> 00:00:03.930
Like, the last several years,

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.490
I think as streaming, like everybody,

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.690
like all those shows that
maybe you were popular

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:08.970
years ago are coming back around.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.600
Is that cool to like, have
a whole new fan base for it?

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.650
- It's totally insane and
mind blowing, honestly.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.280
Like, there are kids who weren't even born

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.310
when the shows started,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.670
who are now like avid fans and it's--

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.020
- Because it's a great show.
- [Ed] And it's a thrill.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.760
Yeah. It's totally, totally amazing.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.480
Randall was on "The Office".
- [Kelly] I know.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.650
- I did an episode and it's crazy

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.130
because I did one--
- Is that what you meant?

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:34.440
I'm just kidding. (laughs)
- That's what I thought?

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.580
But apparently, it wasn't.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.710
But I did

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:37.670
one

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.570
scene

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.090
in one episode.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:42.220
I was in and out in like, a couple hours.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:44.030
- [Kelly] Yeah.
That one scene is probably

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.125
the thing I'm recognized most for

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:47.680
(Kelly and Ed laugh)

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.513
to this day.

00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:50.270
- That's how powerful you are. So..

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:53.450
- It makes our show "True
Story" and "The Office" reunion.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:54.320
- [Randall] That's right.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.250
- [Kelly] It does.
- Right?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.940
- So in "The Office" you
did a lot of acapella.

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.010
And like I mentioned on "The Voice",

00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.310
you came back and you were on "The Voice"

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.350
and I know you kicked
John out of your group,

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.440
but Blake is now a member
of your acapella group.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.880
- [Ed] Yeah and Ariana.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:05.750
The whole gang.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.510
Everybody's in the group.
- [Kelly] Yes. Just not John.

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.950
- Except for John.
(Randall and Kelly laugh)

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.660
Yeah. John and I have,

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:13.630
we've been rivals for decades.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:14.823
- [Kelly] Yeah. Yeah.
- [Randall] Decades.

00:01:15.906 --> 00:01:17.080
- [Kelly] It makes sense--
- Since Beyoncé's party

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.537
and here we are. Yeah.
- [Kelly] Since Beyoncé's...

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:19.370
(Kelly wheezes)

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:20.290
- [Ed] But yeah, I've done--

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:23.750
- Since we had an acapella
at Beyoncé's party.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.583
- Oh, that's right. Of course.

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:26.000
- [Kelly] Did you grow up though really,

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.630
like, singing acapella?

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.820
- Not acapella per se, but I was like,

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.443
kind of like, a chorale nerd.

00:01:31.443 --> 00:01:33.100
- [Kelly] I was too!
- Yeah, okay. So like,

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:34.800
singing all the time.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.927
My buddy Warren Goodrich and I sang

00:01:38.927 --> 00:01:40.730
"More Than Words"

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:43.930
at a high school pep rally which

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:46.810
doesn't even sound cool. I
think we thought it was cool

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:48.190
to do that, but it--

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.190
- I still think it's cool,
which is why I was the nerd.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.670
- And I'm still proud of it.
(Kelly wheezes)

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.503
But I think,

00:01:52.503 --> 00:01:54.840
I think that technically it was not cool.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.040
And that's part of what makes me not cool

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:58.890
is that I don't agree with that.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:00.300
I still think it's cool.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.853
- [Kelly] I still think it's cool.

